#: templates/components/fund-bonds-header.php:5
msgid "Tuleva World Bonds Pension Fund"
msgstr "Tuleva Maailma Võlakirjade Pensionifond"

#: templates/components/fund-bonds-header.php:17
msgid "<strong>A conservative index fund that invests entirely in low-risk bonds.</strong> Lower risk also means lower returns compared to the stock fund. It is impossible to combine low risk with high returns."
msgstr "<strong>Konservatiivne indeksfond, mis investeerib täielikult madala riskiga võlakirjadesse.</strong> Selle fondi oodatav tootlus on oluliselt madalam kui aktsiafondil. Madala riskiga on võimatu head tootlust teenida."

#: templates/components/fund-bonds-header.php:18
msgid "Suitable for you if you plan to withdraw your entire II pillar within the next 5 years and are willing to give up returns for security."
msgstr "Sobib sulle, kui plaanid järgmise 5 aasta jooksul kogu II samba välja võtta ning oled kindluse nimel valmis tootlusest loobuma."

#: templates/components/fund-bonds-header.php:21
msgid "<a href=\"/en/online-bank-instructions/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" data-label=\"fund-details-choose-bonds\">Select this fund</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"/netipanga-juhend/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" data-label=\"fund-details-choose-stocks\">Valin selle fondi</a>"

#: templates/components/fund-manager.php:8
msgid "fund manager"
msgstr "fondijuht"

#: templates/components/fund-manager.php:13
msgid "I follow the principle of Jack Bogle, the founder of Vanguard index funds: keep the investment in a low-cost fund and “don’t peek” – keep the end goal in sight and don’t spend time or money worrying about small fluctuations. I waited for a long time for someone to set up this kind of fund in Estonia. We finally had to take matters into our own hands."
msgstr "“Lähtun Vanguardi indeksifondide asutaja Jack Bogle’i põhimõttest: hoia vara madalate kuludega fondis ja “ära piilu”, ehk keskendu lõppeesmärgile ja ära kuluta raha ega aega lühiajaliste kõikumiste pärast muretsemisele. Ootasin kaua, et keegi ka Eestis sellise fondi teeks. Lõpuks tuli ise teha.”"

#: templates/components/fund-manager.php:15
msgid "Tõnu has been working in the investment field for over 30 years. Before founding Tuleva, he headed an investment company he part-owned, Karu Capital. Before that, Tõnu ran Eastern European financial sector development projects at the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development and worked as head of investment banking at Hansabank. He holds a master’s degree from London Business School-and a bachelor’s degree from the University of Tartu."
msgstr "Tõnu on investeerimisalal tegutsenud üle 30 aasta. Enne Tuleva asutamist juhtis ta oma kaasosalusega investeerimisettevõtet Karu Capital. Varem on Tõnu muuhulgas vedanud Euroopa Rekonstruktsiooni- ning Arengupangas Ida-Euroopa finantssektori arendusprojekte ning töötanud Hansapangas investeerimispanganduse juhina. Tõnu sai finantsteaduste magistriks London Business School-is ja omandas finantsteaduste bakalaureuse kraadi Tartu Ülikoolis."

#: templates/components/fund-savings-details.php:160
msgid "Summary of Investor Rights"
msgstr "Investori õiguste kokkuvõte"

#: templates/components/fund-savings-header.php:12
msgid "Tuleva Savings Fund"
msgstr "Tuleva täiendav kogumisfond"

#: templates/components/fund-stocks-details.php:46
#: templates/components/fund-third-details.php:46
msgid "Aggressive"
msgstr "Agressiivne"

#: templates/components/fund-stocks-header.php:17
msgid "<strong>A low-cost index fund that invests entirely in stocks.</strong> The annual returns of this fund can vary sharply. However, projected long-term returns are nevertheless significantly higher than for the bond fund."
msgstr "<strong>Madala tasuga indeksfond, mis investeerib täielikult aktsiatesse.</strong> Selle fondi tootlus võib järsult aastast-aastasse kõikuda. Oodatav tootlus on sellegipoolest oluliselt kõrgem kui võlakirjafondil."

#: templates/components/fund-stocks-header.php:18
msgid "Suitable for you if you want to achieve <strong>the best long-term returns</strong> and do not plan to withdraw your entire II pillar within the next 5 years."
msgstr "Sobib sulle, kui soovid teenida <strong>parimat pikaajalist tootlust</strong> ja ei plaani järgmise 5 aasta jooksul kogu II sammast välja võtta."

#: templates/components/fund-stocks-header.php:23
msgid "of Tuleva II pillar investors’ choice"
msgstr "Tuleva II sambas kogujate valik"

#: templates/components/fund-stocks-header.php:25
msgid "<a href=\"/en/online-bank-instructions/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" data-label=\"fund-details-choose-stocks\">Select this fund</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"/netipanga-juhend/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" data-label=\"fund-details-choose-stocks\">Valin selle fondi</a>"

#: templates/components/fund-third-details.php:18
msgid "15th October 2019"
msgstr "15. oktoober 2019"

#: templates/components/fund-third-header.php:5
msgid "Tuleva III Pillar Pension Fund"
msgstr "Tuleva III Samba Pensionifond"

#: templates/components/fund-third-header.php:17
msgid "<strong>A low-cost index fund that invests entirely in stocks.</strong> The annual returns of this fund can vary sharply, yet without consciously taking risks, achieving high returns is impossible."
msgstr "<strong>Madala tasuga indeksfond, mis investeerib täielikult aktsiatesse.</strong> Selle fondi tootlus võib järsult aastast-aastasse kõikuda, ent teadlikku riski võtmata ei ole võimalik kõrget tootlust teenida."

#: templates/components/fund-third-header.php:18
msgid "Suitable for you if you want to achieve <strong>the best long-term returns</strong> and do not plan to withdraw your entire III pillar within the next 5 years."
msgstr "Sobib sulle, kui soovid teenida <strong>parimat pikaajalist tootlust</strong> ja ei plaani järgmise 5 aasta jooksul kogu III sammast välja võtta."

